Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: runtest.c
Line: 3043
Function: xptrDocTest
Bug type: out-of-bounds-read
CWE: CWE-125
Explanation: The return value of glob() (line 3042) is not checked. On failure or no matches (e.g., GLOB_NOMATCH), the contents of globbuf.gl_pathc and globbuf.gl_pathv are unspecified. The subsequent loop (line 3043) iterates using globbuf.gl_pathc and dereferences globbuf.gl_pathv[i], which can read invalid/uninitialized memory and crash.

